@GatewayHost = http://localhost:57916
@AgentRole = agent
@CustomerId = 75f05a60-4505-47bb-8d26-f2530d30c440
@MissingCustomerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@AttachmentId = 86381386-a98b-40ac-82e8-a4301aa93005
@NonAgentRole = viewer

### Health check for downstream API (direct check, not via gateway)
GET http://localhost:5215/health/db
Accept: application/json

###

### Create customer profile through gateway (POST /api/customers)
POST {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
	"name": "Aya Gateway",
	"company": "Contoso",
	"contactDetails": [
		{
			"channel": 1,
			"value": "aya.gateway@contoso.com",
			"label": "work",
			"isPrimary": true
		}
	]
}

###

### Profile by customer id through gateway
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Update customer profile through gateway (PUT /api/customers/{customerId})
### Replace rowVersion with latest value from a GET response when needed.
PUT {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
	"name": "Aya Gateway Updated",
	"company": "Contoso Support",
	"rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E=",
	"contactDetails": [
		{
			"channel": 1,
			"value": "aya.updated@contoso.com",
			"label": "work",
			"isPrimary": true
		}
	]
}

###

### Get customer contact details through gateway
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/contact-details
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Add customer note through gateway (POST /notes)
POST {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/notes
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

{
	"body": "Customer follow-up captured via gateway route surface."
}

###

### List customer notes through gateway (GET /notes)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/notes
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Upload customer attachment through gateway (POST /attachments)
POST {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GatewayUploadBoundary

--GatewayUploadBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="gateway-note.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Sample attachment uploaded via gateway.
--GatewayUploadBoundary--

###

### List customer attachments through gateway (GET /attachments)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Download customer attachment content through gateway
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/attachments/{{AttachmentId}}/content
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get interaction history through gateway (default pagination)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Get interaction history through gateway (filters + pagination)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?page=1&pageSize=20&channel=email&direction=inbound
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Validate downstream validation propagation (expected 400)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}/interaction-history?channel=fax
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Validate downstream not found propagation (expected 404)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{MissingCustomerId}}/interaction-history
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{AgentRole}}

###

### Validate unauthorized propagation when header is missing (expected 401)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Validate forbidden propagation for non-agent role (expected 403)
GET {{GatewayHost}}/api/customers/{{CustomerId}}
Accept: application/json
X-User-Role: {{NonAgentRole}}
